{"id":"ro_mer","lemma":"Römer","pos":"noun","rank":3622,"glosses":["Roman"],"ipa":"/ˈrøːmər/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/97/De-R%C3%B6mer.ogg/De-R%C3%B6mer.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"genitive":"Römers","plural":"Römer","feminine":"Römerin"},"examples":[{"text":"Dieses Buch handelt von der Invasion der Römer.","en":"This book deals with the invasion of the Romans.","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"book (collection of…"},{"g":"to act","l":"handeln"},{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"invasion"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Die Römer haben viele Aquädukte erbaut.","en":"The Romans built many aqueducts.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/695224","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"have"},{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},null,{"g":"built"}]},{"text":"Viele Römer sind nach Griechenland gegangen.","en":"Many Romans went to Greece.","words":[{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},null,{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"after / to"},null,{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"}]},{"text":"Wenn man in Rom ist, sollte man sich wie ein Römer verhalten.","en":"When in Rome, do as the Romans do.","words":[{"g":"if / when"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"Rom , Romani"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"should","l":"sollen"},{"g":"one"},{"g":"oneself"},{"g":"how"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"behaviour"}]},{"text":"Viele junge Römer gingen nach Griechenland.","en":"Many young Romans went to Greece.","words":[{"g":"much, a lot","l":"viel"},{"g":"boy"},null,{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"gehen"},{"g":"after / to"},null]}]}